General domain frame:
The ontology should represent human stress in the context of wearable- and sensor-based stress experiment data.
Do not assume a predefined module structure. Instead, derive the relevant conceptual areas, classes, properties, relations, and constraints
primarily from the provided development input.
Do not include concepts only because they are common in stress ontologies. Include them only if they are directly supported, implied, or
reasonably required by the provided input.

